#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:328
msgid "Setup External Applications Used by K3b"
msgstr "Podesi eksterne apikacije korištene od strane K3b"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:338
msgid ""
"<p>K3b uses cdrdao, cdrecord and mkisofs to actually write the CDs. It is "
"recommended to install these programs. K3b will run without them but major "
"functions (for example CD writing!) will be disabled.</p><p>K3b Setup tries "
"to find the executables. You can change the paths manually if you want other "
"versions to be used, or K3b Setup did not find your installation.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>K3b koristi cdrdao, cdrecord i mkisofs za snimanje CD-ova. "
"Preporučeno je instalirati ove programe. Bez njih, K3b će raditi ali većina "
"bitnih funkcija (npr. pisanje CDova!) će biti isključena.</p> <p>K3b Setup "
"pokušava da nađe izvršne datoteke. Možete promijeniti puteve ručno ako "
"želite koristiti drugu verziju programa ili ako K3b Setup nije našao vašu "
"instalaciju.</p>"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:351
msgid "Found"
msgstr "Našao"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:352
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Program"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:353
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verzija"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:354
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Staza"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:360
msgid "Find Program"
msgstr "Nađi program"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:415
msgid ""
"<p><b><font color=\"red\">K3bSetup was unable to find cdrecord. You will not "
"be able to write CDs or get information about your CD drives without it. It "
"is highly recommended to install cdrecord.</font></b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><font color=\"red\">K3bSetup ne može da nađe cdrecord. Nećete moći "
"pisati CD-ove ili dobiti informacije o vašim CD medijima bez njega. "
"Visoko je preporučeno da instalirate cdrecord.</font></b></p>"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:457
msgid "Please Select %1 Executable"
msgstr "Molimo odaberite %1 izvršni program"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:471
msgid "Setup Some Necessary Permissions for K3b"
msgstr "Podesi neke potrebne dozvole za K3b"

#: k3bsetupwizardtabs.cpp:482
msgid ""
"<p>The external programs need to be run as root, since they need write "
"access to the CD drives and to run with higher priority. K3b also needs "
"write access to the CD drives (for extended functionality like detecting the "
"capacity of a CD).</p><p>If you know what you are doing you can skip this "
"and setup the permissions for yourself. However, it is recommended to let "
"K3bSetup make the changes (To learn more about what K3b Setup will do press "
"<i>Details</i>).</p><p>Please specify the users that will use K3b. You can "
"also specify an alternative group name. If you do not know what that means "
"just use the default.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Vanjski programi moraju biti pokrenuti pod root privilegijama, s obzirom da trebaju "
"pravo za pisanje CD-ova i moraju da se pokreću sa visokim prioritetom. K3b takođe treba "
"pravo pisanja na CD uređaje (za proširenu funkcionalnost kao što je detekcija kapaciteta CD-a) "
"</p><p>Ako znate šta radite možete ovo preskočiti i postaviti dozvole samostalno. Ipak, najbolje je da "
"K3bSetup napravi promjene (da naučite više o K3b Setup-u možete pritisnuti <i>Detalji</i>).</p> "
"<p>Molim navedite korisnike koji će koristiti K3b. Takođe možete navesti alternativno ime grupe. "
"Ako ne znate šta ovo znači, samo koristite standardne vrijednosti.</p>"

